{"id":"633593","name":"猪肉豇豆煎包","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633593/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"200克"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"100克"},{"name":"豇豆","amount":"80克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"2克"},{"name":"清水","amount":"110克"},{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪肉放绞肉机打成肉馅，放盐、姜末、20克清水，绞打上劲。","img":"images/633593/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豇豆焯水。","img":"images/633593/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切碎。","img":"images/633593/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"葱切好。","img":"images/633593/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"食材放在一起，放芝麻油、大葱。","img":"images/633593/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"拌匀备用。","img":"images/633593/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"香葱准备好。","img":"images/633593/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"面粉、加入酵母，合成一个面团，醒发至两倍大，揉面拍气。","img":"images/633593/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"擀成包子皮。","img":"images/633593/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入馅料。","img":"images/633593/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"全部包好，醒发10分钟。","img":"images/633593/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"平底锅放油。","img":"images/633593/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入包子，小火慢慢煎。","img":"images/633593/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"底部煎至金黄。","img":"images/633593/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"倒入清水，没过包子的1/3处。","img":"images/633593/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"盖上锅盖，烧8分钟。","img":"images/633593/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"水分收干，撒香葱、黑芝麻。","img":"images/633593/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/633593/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"美味。","img":"images/633593/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}